             699                     
             700                     !  --- ...  prepare sensible heat (h) for return to parent model
             701                     
             702                           sheat = -(ch*cp1*sfcprs) / (rd1*t2v) * (th2 - t1)
             703                     
             704                     !  --- ...  convert units and/or sign of total evap (eta), potential evap (etp),
             705                     !           subsurface heat flux (s), and runoffs for what parent model expects
